{"id":"17de8347f6f91384","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-smooth.md","title":"Smooth Function","display":"df-smooth — Smooth Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-smooth","aliases":["58-df-smooth","Smooth Function"],"display":"df-smooth — Smooth Function","depends_on":["[[58-df-differentiable]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-smooth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-smooth</span><span>Smooth Function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smooth — Smooth Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fde79d92b8305394\" href=\"?note=fde79d92b8305394\" title=\"58-df-differentiable\">58-df-differentiable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n,m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\">\\(U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in(\\mathbb R^m)^U\">\\(f\\in(\\mathbb R^m)^U\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n^{\\leq k}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\leq k}n^r\">\\(n^{\\leq k}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\leq k}n^r\\)</span> is the set of coordinate words of length at most <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_i\">\\(e_i\\)</span> is the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span>-th standard basis vector.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> is the function predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EuclideanContinuous}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EuclideanContinuous}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S\\)</span> are predicates defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^1\">\\(\\mathbb R^1\\)</span> 使用函数编码，故不直接等同于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span>。实标量空间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^k(U,\\mathbb R)\">\\(C^k(U,\\mathbb R)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^\\infty(U,\\mathbb R)\">\\(C^\\infty(U,\\mathbb R)\\)</span> 由下列一维提升定义，既有向量值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^k(U,\\mathbb R^m)\">\\(C^k(U,\\mathbb R^m)\\)</span> 接口保持不变。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S(f,U)\">\\(\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S(f,U)\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathbb R^U\">\\(f\\in\\mathbb R^U\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealScalarProjection}_S(g,U)\">\\(\\mathrm{RealScalarProjection}_S(g,U)\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in(\\mathbb R^1)^U\">\\(g\\in(\\mathbb R^1)^U\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\">\\(r\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z,w\\in\\mathbb R^r\">\\(z,w\\in\\mathbb R^r\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|z\\|=(\\sum_{j\\in r}z(j)^2)^{1/2}\">\\(\\|z\\|=(\\sum_{j\\in r}z(j)^2)^{1/2}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z-w=\\{\\langle j,z(j)-w(j)\\rangle:j\\in r\\}\">\\(z-w=\\{\\langle j,z(j)-w(j)\\rangle:j\\in r\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"az=\\{\\langle j,az(j)\\rangle:j\\in r\\}\">\\(az=\\{\\langle j,az(j)\\rangle:j\\in r\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_i=\\{\\langle i,1\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle j,0\\rangle:j\\in n\\setminus\\{i\\}\\}\">\\(e_i=\\{\\langle i,1\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle j,0\\rangle:j\\in n\\setminus\\{i\\}\\}\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in n\">\\(i\\in n\\)</span>）；加法按同一逐坐标规则给出。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}open}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(U,n)\\leftrightarrow U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land\n\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;(\\|y-x\\|&lt;r\\to y\\in U)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}open}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(U,n)\\leftrightarrow U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land\n\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;(\\|y-x\\|&lt;r\\to y\\in U)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}continuous}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EuclideanContinuous}_S(g,U,m)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(g,U,\\mathbb R^m)\\land\n\\forall x\\in U\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in U\\;(\\|y-x\\|&lt;\\delta\\to\\|g(y)-g(x)\\|&lt;\\varepsilon)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}continuous}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EuclideanContinuous}_S(g,U,m)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(g,U,\\mathbb R^m)\\land\n\\forall x\\in U\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in U\\;(\\|y-x\\|&lt;\\delta\\to\\|g(y)-g(x)\\|&lt;\\varepsilon)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}tower}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S(F,f,U,n,m,k)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;k\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,U,\\mathbb R^m)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(F,n^{\\leq k},(\\mathbb R^m)^U\\right)\\land F(\\varnothing)=f\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall s\\in n^{&lt;k}\\;\\forall i\\in n\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\nF(s^\\frown\\langle i\\rangle)(x)=\n\\lim_{\\substack{t\\to0\\\\t\\neq0,\\ x+te_i\\in U}}\n\\frac{F(s)(x+te_i)-F(s)(x)}{t}\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}tower}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S(F,f,U,n,m,k)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;k\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,U,\\mathbb R^m)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(F,n^{\\leq k},(\\mathbb R^m)^U\\right)\\land F(\\varnothing)=f\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall s\\in n^{&lt;k}\\;\\forall i\\in n\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\nF(s^\\frown\\langle i\\rangle)(x)=\n\\lim_{\\substack{t\\to0\\\\t\\neq0,\\ x+te_i\\in U}}\n\\frac{F(s)(x+te_i)-F(s)(x)}{t}\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}finite}\\vdash\nf\\in C^k(U,\\mathbb R^m)\\leftrightarrow n,m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land k\\in\\omega\\land\n\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(U,n)\\land\n\\exists F\\;\\left(\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S(F,f,U,n,m,k)\\land\n\\forall s\\in n^{\\leq k}\\;\\mathrm{EuclideanContinuous}_S(F(s),U,m)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}finite}\\vdash\nf\\in C^k(U,\\mathbb R^m)\\leftrightarrow n,m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land k\\in\\omega\\land\n\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(U,n)\\land\n\\exists F\\;\\left(\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S(F,f,U,n,m,k)\\land\n\\forall s\\in n^{\\leq k}\\;\\mathrm{EuclideanContinuous}_S(F(s),U,m)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}infinite}\\vdash\nf\\in C^\\infty(U,\\mathbb R^m)\\leftrightarrow n,m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(U,n)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,U,\\mathbb R^m)\\land\n\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists F\\;\\left(\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S(F,f,U,n,m,k)\\land\n\\forall s\\in n^{\\leq k}\\;\\mathrm{EuclideanContinuous}_S(F(s),U,m)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}infinite}\\vdash\nf\\in C^\\infty(U,\\mathbb R^m)\\leftrightarrow n,m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(U,n)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,U,\\mathbb R^m)\\land\n\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists F\\;\\left(\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S(F,f,U,n,m,k)\\land\n\\forall s\\in n^{\\leq k}\\;\\mathrm{EuclideanContinuous}_S(F(s),U,m)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}real\\text{-}scalar\\text{-}lift}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S(f,U)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle x,\\{\\langle0,f(x)\\rangle\\}\\rangle:x\\in U\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{RealScalarProjection}_S(g,U)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,g(x)(0)\\rangle:x\\in U\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}real\\text{-}scalar\\text{-}lift}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S(f,U)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle x,\\{\\langle0,f(x)\\rangle\\}\\rangle:x\\in U\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{RealScalarProjection}_S(g,U)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,g(x)(0)\\rangle:x\\in U\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}real\\text{-}finite}\\vdash\nC^k(U,\\mathbb R)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathbb R^U:\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S(f,U)\\in C^k(U,\\mathbb R^1)\\}\\quad(k\\in\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}real\\text{-}finite}\\vdash\nC^k(U,\\mathbb R)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathbb R^U:\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S(f,U)\\in C^k(U,\\mathbb R^1)\\}\\quad(k\\in\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}real\\text{-}infinite}\\vdash\nC^\\infty(U,\\mathbb R)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathbb R^U:\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S(f,U)\\in C^\\infty(U,\\mathbb R^1)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}real\\text{-}infinite}\\vdash\nC^\\infty(U,\\mathbb R)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathbb R^U:\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S(f,U)\\in C^\\infty(U,\\mathbb R^1)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Coordinate derivatives are represented by a finite word-indexed tower, so neither derivative existence nor continuity is hidden in an undeclared predicate.</li>\n<li>A smooth function has continuous partial derivatives of every finite order.</li>\n<li>Real analyticity is a stronger, separate notion; it is not an additional clause defining smoothness.</li>\n<li>Smooth functions need not be analytic, as compactly supported bump functions show.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Spivak, Calculus on Manifolds</li>\n<li>Lee, Introduction to Smooth Manifolds</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-differentiable","status":"resolved","id":"fde79d92b8305394","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-differentiable]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ is the function predicate from [[58-df-function]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n,m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in(\\mathbb R^m)^U","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"n^{\\leq k}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\leq k}n^r","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"e_i","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EuclideanContinuous}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"C^k(U,\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"C^\\infty(U,\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"C^k(U,\\mathbb R^m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S(f,U)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathbb R^U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RealScalarProjection}_S(g,U)","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in(\\mathbb R^1)^U","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\omega_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"z,w\\in\\mathbb R^r","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\|z\\|=(\\sum_{j\\in r}z(j)^2)^{1/2}","display":false},{"tex":"z-w=\\{\\langle j,z(j)-w(j)\\rangle:j\\in r\\}","display":false},{"tex":"az=\\{\\langle j,az(j)\\rangle:j\\in r\\}","display":false},{"tex":"e_i=\\{\\langle i,1\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle j,0\\rangle:j\\in n\\setminus\\{i\\}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}open}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(U,n)\\leftrightarrow U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land\n\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;(\\|y-x\\|<r\\to y\\in U)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}continuous}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EuclideanContinuous}_S(g,U,m)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(g,U,\\mathbb R^m)\\land\n\\forall x\\in U\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall y\\in U\\;(\\|y-x\\|<\\delta\\to\\|g(y)-g(x)\\|<\\varepsilon)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}tower}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S(F,f,U,n,m,k)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&k\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,U,\\mathbb R^m)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(F,n^{\\leq k},(\\mathbb R^m)^U\\right)\\land F(\\varnothing)=f\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall s\\in n^{<k}\\;\\forall i\\in n\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\nF(s^\\frown\\langle i\\rangle)(x)=\n\\lim_{\\substack{t\\to0\\\\t\\neq0,\\ x+te_i\\in U}}\n\\frac{F(s)(x+te_i)-F(s)(x)}{t}\n\\end{aligned}\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}finite}\\vdash\nf\\in C^k(U,\\mathbb R^m)\\leftrightarrow n,m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land k\\in\\omega\\land\n\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(U,n)\\land\n\\exists F\\;\\left(\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S(F,f,U,n,m,k)\\land\n\\forall s\\in n^{\\leq k}\\;\\mathrm{EuclideanContinuous}_S(F(s),U,m)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}infinite}\\vdash\nf\\in C^\\infty(U,\\mathbb R^m)\\leftrightarrow n,m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(U,n)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,U,\\mathbb R^m)\\land\n\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists F\\;\\left(\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S(F,f,U,n,m,k)\\land\n\\forall s\\in n^{\\leq k}\\;\\mathrm{EuclideanContinuous}_S(F(s),U,m)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}real\\text{-}scalar\\text{-}lift}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S(f,U)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle x,\\{\\langle0,f(x)\\rangle\\}\\rangle:x\\in U\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{RealScalarProjection}_S(g,U)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,g(x)(0)\\rangle:x\\in U\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}real\\text{-}finite}\\vdash\nC^k(U,\\mathbb R)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathbb R^U:\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S(f,U)\\in C^k(U,\\mathbb R^1)\\}\\quad(k\\in\\omega).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}real\\text{-}infinite}\\vdash\nC^\\infty(U,\\mathbb R)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathbb R^U:\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S(f,U)\\in C^\\infty(U,\\mathbb R^1)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":4243,"backlinks":[{"id":"e72ce9e8de4a5cad","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S$ (word-indexed partial-derivative tower; see [[../batch15/58-df-smooth.md]])"},{"id":"70a18be302d94faf","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bc125fa84031840f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a6c5654857edae16","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"76305a7e4d824323","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$C^\\infty(\\Omeg